title: "causal-hybrid-control"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ilia
    family-names: Gradina
    email: ilia.gradina@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/causaldyn/causal-hybrid-control"
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-07-29"
abstract: >-
  Physics-structured dynamics with a learned causal residual, controlled by constrained optimal
  control and MPC, and made safe on offline confounded data by an explicit pessimism and support
  layer. Includes causal identification of a control-affine residual's control channel from
  confounded logs, sensitivity-aware control under hidden confounding, control-barrier certification
  under a partially identified effect, and a machine-checked (Rocq) result line at the causal/control
  seam.
keywords:
  - causal inference
  - optimal control
  - model predictive control
  - system identification
  - scientific machine learning
  - hybrid models
  - offline reinforcement learning
  - jax
